<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Hello {{.Data.name}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">{{with index .Data "kind"}}{{if eq . "role_requested"}}A platform administrator requested the {{index $.Data "role"}} role for a user. It takes effect only when a second administrator approves it.{{else if eq . "role_granted"}}The {{index $.Data "role"}} role was granted to a user.{{else if eq . "role_rejected"}}A request for the {{index $.Data "role"}} role was rejected or withdrawn.{{else if eq . "role_revoke_requested"}}A platform administrator requested the revocation of a {{index $.Data "role"}} role. It takes effect only when a second administrator confirms it.{{else if eq . "role_revoked"}}A {{index $.Data "role"}} role was revoked.{{else}}A platform role assignment changed.{{end}}{{end}}</p>
<p style="margin:0;"><a href="{{index .Data "link"}}" style="color:#1d4ed8;">Review the platform role assignments</a>.</p>
